# DoS in npm's own bundled brace-expansion / undici (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm).
# Only reachable when a user runs npm inside their own single-use sandbox; npm@latest
# (installed in the Dockerfile) still bundles the vulnerable versions, so there is no
# upgrade path yet. Re-check when npm ships brace-expansion >= 5.0.11 and
# undici >= 6.28.1. (owner: @khalbabs, accepted 2026-10-07)
